safix::no_declaration_file

  × safix/users/cy.nix is not a custody record this can extend, so cy's
  │ recovery
  │ recipients were not touched.
  │ 
  │ Enrollment adds a recipient to a record that already declares one. The
  │ record is written by:
  │ 
  │     safix adduser cy <age-recipient>
  │ 
  │ A record living somewhere else is supported — declarations merge, so where
  │ one is written is not something safix knows — but the edit has to have a
  │ file to make, so move it to that path or add the recipient by hand and
  │ re-run for the rest of the ceremony.
